; icons.paths -- the toolkit's symbolic icons and the pointer as shapes,
; which tools/mkfont rasterizes for scale 2 (user/lib/ui/face.l0): the
; same icons as user/lib/ui/icons.l0's 16 by 16 art, drawn with smooth
; edges. Its language is tools/mkfont/shape.l0's. An icon is "icon NAME"
; then its shapes, on a grid of 16 whatever its size; the pointer is
; "cursor" then its shapes, each white or black, in the pointer's pixels
; at scale 1, its hot spot at 0, 0, the black drawn over the white.

icon window-close
stroke 1.75 M 4.5 4.5 L 11.5 11.5
stroke 1.75 M 11.5 4.5 L 4.5 11.5

icon pan-down
stroke 2 M 3.5 6 L 8 10.5 L 12.5 6

icon pan-up
stroke 2 M 3.5 10 L 8 5.5 L 12.5 10

; A circle's arrow: round from the right, under, and up to the top,
; where its head points on.
icon view-refresh
arc 8 8.5 5 1.5 -10 270
fill M 8 1 L 11.5 3.5 L 8 6 Z

icon open-menu
rrect 3 4 10 2 1
rrect 3 7 10 2 1
rrect 3 10 10 2 1

icon system-search
ring 6.5 6.5 3.75 1.5
stroke 2 M 9.5 9.5 L 13.5 13.5

; A drive: its case, the line where its bay begins, and its light.
icon drive-harddisk
frame 1 3 14 10 2 1
rect 2 8 12 1
rect 11 10 2 1

; A terminal: its prompt, and the cursor after it.
icon utilities-terminal
stroke 1.5 M 2.5 4.5 L 5.75 7.75 L 2.5 11
rect 7 10.25 7 1.5

; A system monitor: a pulse, up and down across a level line.
icon utilities-system-monitor
stroke 1.25 M 0.5 7.5 H 2 L 4 3.5 L 7 11.5 L 9.5 7.5 H 15.5

; A grid of apps: three rows of three squares.
icon view-app-grid
rrect 0 0 4 4 0.75
rrect 6 0 4 4 0.75
rrect 12 0 4 4 0.75
rrect 0 6 4 4 0.75
rrect 6 6 4 4 0.75
rrect 12 6 4 4 0.75
rrect 0 12 4 4 0.75
rrect 6 12 4 4 0.75
rrect 12 12 4 4 0.75

; Adwaita's pointer: a black arrow edged white.
cursor
white fill M 0 0 L 11.5 11.5 L 7 11.5 L 9.8 16.6 L 7.4 17.6 L 4.7 12.3 L 0 15.8 Z
black fill M 1 2.4 L 9.1 10.5 L 5.4 10.5 L 8.4 16.1 L 7.9 16.3 L 4.9 10.7 L 1 13.6 Z
